{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07247","headline":"杂咏八首上礼部李侍郎 旧井 · 刘长卿","name":"杂咏八首上礼部李侍郎 旧井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧井依旧城，寒水深洞彻。\n下看百余尺，一镜光不灭。\n素绠久未垂，清凉尚含洁。\n岂能无汲引，长讶君恩绝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}